Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- _detect_tool_failure: when terminal exit_code=0 and output exists,
  show '→ "first_line ... last_line"' preview on the TUI completion line
- Single-line output shows full line (up to 60 chars)
- Multi-line output shows first 30 ... last 30
- Fixed display.py escape issue in the web_extract patch block

complements: web_extract content preview (22cadee)
related: nija-policy v4.3 源码闭环审计
---
 agent/display.py                | 9 +++++++++
 plugins/nija-policy/plugin.yaml | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/agent/display.py b/agent/display.py
index 31b2c73..67b1d36 100644
--- a/agent/display.py
+++ b/agent/display.py
@@ -829,6 +829,15 @@ def _detect_tool_failure(tool_name: str, result: str | None) -> tuple[bool, str]
     if tool_name == "terminal":
         if isinstance(data, dict):
             exit_code = data.get("exit_code")
+            output = data.get("output", "")
+            # Success with output — show first and last line preview
+            if exit_code == 0 and output.strip():
+                lines = output.strip().split('\n')
+                if len(lines) == 1:
+                    preview = lines[0][:60]
+                else:
+                    preview = f"{lines[0][:30]} ... {lines[-1][:30]}"
+                return True, f" → "{preview}""
             if exit_code is not None and exit_code != 0:
                 err_msg = data.get("error")
                 if err_msg:
diff --git a/plugins/nija-policy/plugin.yaml b/plugins/nija-policy/plugin.yaml
index 5a01afa..197a9ba 100644
--- a/plugins/nija-policy/plugin.yaml
+++ b/plugins/nija-policy/plugin.yaml
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 name: nija-policy
-version: 4.1.0
-description: "Nija 策略插件 v4.1——双闸门(全读+覆盖率)+SKILL STATS v4.1回合边界冷却+时间戳刷新+HARD GATE+P0智能门+语义审计"
+version: 4.3.0
+description: "Nija 策略插件 v4.3——源码闭环审计+框架工具闸门+双闸门(全读+覆盖率)+SKILL STATS v4.1+HARD GATE+P0智能门"
